  vendorName: Surveyor Winslow
  offerText: Your quarters are improperly measured. Pay my strict inspection fee,
    and I will officially rezone your walls, granting you significantly more living
    space and peace of mind.
  acceptResultText: Winslow takes your cash, taps your wall twice with his cane,
    scribbles on his clipboard, and walks away. Your room is exactly the same size.
    You were completely robbed.
  rejectResultText: You slam the door on the corrupt official. Keeping your money
    safe from bureaucratic leeches feels fantastic.
